<title>CANADA: Canada to auction C$2.3 bln bonds due 2007.</title>
<headline>Canada to auction C$2.3 bln bonds due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said it plans to auction on February 12 C$2.3 billion of bonds with a coupon of 7.25 percent and maturing on June 1, 2007.</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada said it will buy at least C$345 million of the new bonds.</p>
<p>The bonds, which will be dated and delivered on February 17, pay interest on June 1 and December 1, the government said.</p>
</text>
